  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">담임반 학생들 학생 건강 자가진단을 교사가 안드로이드 어플에서 확인이 가능한걸 소개합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안드로드이폰만 가능하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개발하신 선생님이 아이폰은 개발중이라고 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">참고로 오늘</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(06.17) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부터 고등학교도 업데이트 되었다고 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저는 고등학교 담임이라</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">오늘 처음 사용해봤는데 학생 자가진단 확인하는데 편했습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">댓글의 이미지처럼 자가진단 안한 학생은 회색 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">정상은 녹색 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">/ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등교중지는 빨간색으로 나옵니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학생이름 클릭하면 자가진단 세부 내용도 보입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어플내에서 교사 지역</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이름</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인증번호가 저장되어서 매번 입력 할필요가 없습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안드로드이폰만 가능하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개발하신 선생님이 아이폰은 개발중이라고 합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" 